- Persistence of the chosen theme using the browser's `localStorage`;
- Automatic detection of the user's operating system theme preference via media queries;
- Smooth transitions between state changes to avoid unpleasant visual impacts.

detalheResultado.en:
▶ Fluid theme switching without visual stutters;
▶ Maintenance of user preference even after closing or reloading the page;
▶ Reusable code that is easily integrable into larger-scale projects, used for example in this portfolio.

